  {
    "objectID": "01_intro.html#script-set-up",
    "href": "01_intro.html#script-set-up",
    "title": "1  Introduction",
    "section": "",
    "text": "# Check current working directory\ngetwd()\n\n# Set a new working directory.\nsetwd(\"C:/Users/YourName/Desktop/AE_2026\")\n\n# Verify the change\ngetwd()\n\n# List files in the working directory\ndir()",
